I can open and download this document in the sub portal at any time, and Penney will give me a paper copy free if I ask. I can stop signing electronically for future documents by telling Penney in writing; that does not change documents already signed.
My typed name, the date and time, my portal login, and my device and internet address are recorded with my signature and printed on the signed copy.$penney_w9$
